      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 483696164,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I am not 100% sure about the \"return 1\".\n\n* \"return 0\" would just push the data back and wait for more -> does not work\n* \"return n\" (0 > n > header_len) works but leads to malformed packets on the segments that do not fit (at the beginning)\n\nCan I avoid the malformed packets?",
