          "id": 484916673,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Removed the WIP since \"return 1\" seems to be the best solution. Marking the tcp-segments that are in the middle of DoIP message without the header as DoIP and \"malformed\" seems to be ok. Actually, marking these segments like that makes sense since they are out of the middle of a unparseable message.",
